## How this works

This repository is a per-company instance of [Juvant OS](https://github.com/juvantlabs/juvant-os),
a multi-agent operating system that runs on Claude Code. {{CEO_NAME}} (CEO) drives the company by
speaking to the JUVANT_OS Skill in Claude Code.

To enter:

```bash
cd /path/to/this/repo
claude
```

Then ask the Skill anything: *"Status check"*, *"Cost report"*, *"Add project &lt;name&gt;"*,
*"Hire CRO"*, *"Run CSO audit"*, etc.

State lives in [Turso](https://turso.tech) (or local SQLite for testing instances) at
`.juvant/state.db`, gitignored. The founding company-scope agents communicate through state,
not directly with each other. See [`JUVANT_OS.md`](JUVANT_OS.md) for the orchestrator semantics
and [`SYSTEM_INVARIANTS.md`](SYSTEM_INVARIANTS.md) for framework invariants.

